@Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress = http://localhost:3000

### Root redirect to Swagger
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Home endpoint (redirects to Swagger UI)
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/home
Accept: application/json

### Home status endpoint
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/home/status
Accept: application/json

### Start registration
POST {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/api/account/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "fullName": "Example Customer",
  "password": "a-secure-password"
}

### Verify registration (replace OTP)
POST {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/api/account/registrations/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Local login (sets access_token + refresh_token HttpOnly cookies)
POST {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "a-secure-password",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### Renew the cookies when access_token is expired (refresh_token rotates)
POST {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh

### Current profile (requires access_token cookie from login)
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/api/account/profile
Accept: application/json

### Start password reset (always returns 202)
POST {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/api/account/password-resets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com"
}
